[41.740886, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI'll start by inspecting the working directory and available tools, then examine the test input format and any existing code.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app 2>/dev/null || cd .; pwd; ls -la; echo '---'; which upcrun upcc 2>/dev/null || true; echo '---'; head -5 test 2>/dev/null || head -5 /app/test \r\n2>/dev/null || true; echo '---'; wc -l test 2>/dev/null || wc -l /app/test 2>/dev/null || true\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
