[68.539209, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe test graph resolves into 6 linear contigs with no branching. Now I'll install Berkeley UPC (SMP mode) as specified. This may take a few minutes to build.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /tmp && if [ ! -f berkeley_upc-2022.10.0.tar.gz ]; then wget -q https://upc.lbl.gov/download/release/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0.tar.gz; fi && tar xzf \r\nberkeley_upc-2022.10.0.tar.gz && cd berkeley_upc-2022.10.0 && ./configure --prefix=/usr/local --disable-mpi --enable-smp --disable-ibv --disable-shmem \r\n--disable-ofi --disable-ucx > /tmp/upc_configure.log 2>&1 && make -j$(nproc) > /tmp/upc_make.log 2>&1 && make install > /tmp/upc_install.log 2>&1 && echo \r\nINSTALL_OK || (echo FAILED; tail -50 /tmp/upc_configure.log; tail -50 /tmp/upc_make.log; tail -50 /tmp/upc_install.log)\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
