[101.31729, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe build exceeded the command time limit, so I'll run the installation in the background and poll its progress across commands.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /tmp && ls -lh berkeley_upc-2022.10.0.tar.gz 2>/dev/null; ls -d berkeley_upc-2022.10.0 2>/dev/null; if [ ! -d berkeley_upc-2022.10.0 ]; then tar xzf \r\nberkeley_upc-2022.10.0.tar.gz; fi; cd berkeley_upc-2022.10.0 && (./configure --prefix=/usr/local --disable-mpi --enable-smp --disable-ibv --disable-shmem \r\n--disable-ofi --disable-ucx > /tmp/upc_configure.log 2>&1; echo $? > /tmp/upc_configure.status) & echo STARTED_PID=$!\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[101.317694, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
