[283.246415, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe corrected serial version now produces exactly 6 contigs with lengths matching the six graph components. Next I'll check the UPC build and inspect Berkeley \r\nUPC headers/examples for correct shared-memory APIs.\r\n\r\n```\r\nif [ -f /tmp/upc_build.done ]; then echo DONE; else echo BUILDING; fi; for f in /tmp/upc_configure.status /tmp/upc_make.status /tmp/upc_install.status; do [ -f \r\n$f ] && echo \"$f=$(cat $f)\"; done; tail -3 /tmp/upc_make.log 2>/dev/null | cut -c1-200; ls -l /usr/local/bin/upcc /usr/local/bin/upcrun 2>/dev/null || true\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
