[286.193595, "o", "\r\u001b[2KBerkeley UPC is installed successfully. I'll verify the compiler/runtime with a tiny UPC program before implementing the full parallel version.\r\n\r\n```\r\nexport PATH=/usr/local/bin:$PATH\r\nupcc --version | head -5\r\ncat > /tmp/hello.upc <<'EOF'\r\n#include <upc.h>\r\n#include <stdio.h>\r\nshared int A[THREADS];\r\nint main(void) {\r\n  A[MYTHREAD] = MYTHREAD * 10;\r\n  upc_barrier;\r\n  if (MYTHREAD == 0) {\r\n    for (int i = 0; i < THREADS; i++) printf(\"%d \", A[i]);\r\n    printf(\"\\n\");\r\n  }\r\n  return 0;\r\n}\r\nEOF\r\nupcc -o /tmp/hello /tmp/hello.upc && upcrun -n 4 -shared-heap 256MB /tmp/hello\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[286.19407, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
