[291.373498, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe compiler works, but `upcrun` reports a missing node specification. I'll inspect its usage to find the correct SMP invocation flags.\r\n\r\n```\r\nexport PATH=/usr/local/bin:$PATH\r\nupcrun --help 2>&1 | head -80; echo '---'; upcrun -help 2>&1 | head -40; echo '--- version'; upcrun --version 2>&1 | head -30\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠼\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
