[371.797686, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe UPC compiler accepts `-O` rather than `-O2`. I'll rebuild with the supported optimization flag.\r\n\r\n```\r\nexport PATH=/usr/local/bin:$PATH\r\ncd /app && upcc -network=smp -O -o pgen pgen.upc 2>&1 | head -80; echo EXIT=${PIPESTATUS[0]}; ls -l pgen 2>/dev/null\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[371.798209, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
