[377.270554, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe dynamic-thread UPC translator requires explicit block-size syntax for static shared arrays. I'll inspect installed UPC examples/headers for the correct \r\ndeclaration form, then adjust.\r\n\r\n```\r\ngrep -R \"shared \\[.*\\].*\\[\" -n /usr/local/share 2>/dev/null | head -20; echo '--- examples'; find /usr/local -path '*upc*' -name '*.upc' 2>/dev/null | head -20;\r\necho '--- docs'; find /usr/local -iname '*upc*' -type f 2>/dev/null | grep -E 'example|README|test' | head -20\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[377.270769, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[377.279242, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
