[388.43068, "o", "<returncode>\r\n2\r\n<output>\r\nError during remote HTTP translation:\r\nupcc: error during UPC-to-C translation (sgiupc stage): \r\n/tmp/static_test.upc:3: In the dynamic translation environment, THREADS must appear exactly once in declarations of shared arrays with definite block size.  \r\nOffending variable: A\r\n/tmp/static_test.upc:4: In the dynamic translation environment, THREADS must appear exactly once in declarations of shared arrays with definite block size.  \r\nOffending variable: B\r\n\r\n/bin/sh: 15: Bad substitution\r\n\r\n"]
