[419.478561, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe UPC program compiles successfully. I'll run it with 4 threads and compare the resulting contigs against the serial output.\r\n\r\n```\r\nexport PATH=/usr/local/bin:$PATH\r\ncd /app\r\nrm -f /app/pgen*.out\r\ntimeout 60 upcrun -n 4 -shared-heap 256MB /app/pgen /app/test > /tmp/pgen_run.log 2>&1; rc=$?; echo RC=$rc; head -20 /tmp/pgen_run.log; echo '--- outputs ---'; \r\nls -l /app/pgen*.out 2>/dev/null; echo '--- counts ---'; wc -l /app/serial.out /app/pgen_0.out 2>/dev/null; echo '--- diff exact ---'; if cmp -s /app/serial.out\r\n/app/pgen_0.out; then echo IDENTICAL; else echo DIFFER; diff -u /app/serial.out /app/pgen_0.out | head -60; fi\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
