[459.409898, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m34\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[459.411506, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe build and verification succeed. I'll clean up the compilation warning and then validate serial/parallel equivalence on a synthetic graph containing a cycle,\r\nan isolated k-mer, a linear path, and a dangling extension.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app\r\npython3 - <<'PY'\r\np='serial.c'\r\ns=open(p).read()\r\ns=s.replace('''    char **contigs = (char **)malloc((size_t)n * sizeof(char *));\r\n    if (!contigs) { fprintf(stderr, \"serial: out of memory\\\\n\"); return 1; }''','''    size_t n_contigs = (size_t)n;\r\n    if (n_contigs > SIZE_MAX / sizeof(char *)) {\r\n        fprintf(stderr, \"serial: input too large\\\\n\");\r\n        return 1;\r\n    }\r\n    char **contigs = (char **)malloc(n_contigs * sizeof(char *));\r\n    if (!contigs) { fprintf(stderr, \"serial: out of memory\\\\n\"); return 1; }''')\r\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\r\nPY\r\nmake serial 2>&1 | tee /tmp/serial_build.log\r\ncat > /tmp/test_edge <<'EOF'\r\nAAA     FF\r\nAAC     AG\r\nACG     GT\r\nCGT     FF\r\nGGG     GG\r\nTTT     TG\r\nTTG     GG\r\nTGG     GT\r\nGGT     GT\r\nGTT     TT\r\nCCC     FA\r\nEOF\r\n./serial /tmp/test_edge\r\ncp /app/serial.out /tmp/serial_edge.out\r\nexport PATH=/usr/local/bin:$PATH\r\nrm -f /app/pgen*.out\r\nupcrun -n 4 -shared-heap 256MB /app/pgen /tmp/test_edge > /tmp/pgen_edge.log 2>&1; rc=$?\r\necho \"pgen edge rc=$rc\"; cat /tmp/serial_edge.out; echo '--- cmp ---'; if cmp -s /tmp/serial_edge.out /app/pgen_0.out; then echo EDGE_IDENTICAL; else echo \r\nEDGE_DIFFER; diff -u /tmp/serial_edge.out /app/pgen_0.out; fi\r\necho '--- warnings? ---'; grep -E 'warning:|error:' /tmp/serial_build.log || echo none\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[459.414334, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[460.598128, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[460.598252, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\ngcc -O2 -Wall -Wextra -o serial serial.c\r\npgen edge rc=0\r\nAAA\r\nAACGT\r\nCCC\r\nGGG\r\nTTTGGTT\r\n--- cmp ---\r\nEDGE_IDENTICAL\r\n--- warnings? ---\r\nnone\r\n\r\n"]
