[475.181955, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe synthetic edge-case graph (cycle, isolated node, linear path, dangling extension) also matches exactly. I'll now do a clean final build and verification on \r\nthe provided 10,000-line test to leave the required artifacts in place.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app\r\nmake clean >/tmp/final_clean.log 2>&1\r\nmake >/tmp/final_make.log 2>&1\r\nmake verify >/tmp/final_verify.log 2>&1\r\nrc=$?\r\necho \"VERIFY_RC=$rc\"\r\ncat /tmp/final_make.log\r\ncat /tmp/final_verify.log\r\necho '--- deliverables ---'\r\nls -l /app/Makefile /app/serial.c /app/pgen.upc /app/serial /app/pgen /app/serial.out /app/pgen_0.out\r\necho '--- output summary ---'\r\nwc -l /app/serial.out /app/pgen_0.out\r\nsha256sum /app/serial.out /app/pgen_0.out\r\necho '--- contig lengths ---'\r\nawk '{print length($0)}' /app/serial.out\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[475.182554, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[478.014571, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[478.015697, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\nVERIFY_RC=0\r\ngcc -O2 -Wall -Wextra -o serial serial.c\r\n/usr/local/bin/upcc -network=smp -O -o pgen pgen.upc\r\n./serial test\r\nrm -f /app/pgen_*.out\r\n/usr/local/bin/upcrun -n 4 -shared-heap 256MB ./pgen test\r\nUPCR: UPC thread 0 of 4 on f7d7a33ec365 (pshm node 0 of 1, process 0 of 4, pid=54710)\r\nUPCR: UPC thread 1 of 4 on f7d7a33ec365 (pshm node 0 of 1, process 1 of 4, pid=54728)\r\nUPCR: UPC thread 2 of 4 on f7d7a33ec365 (pshm node 0 of 1, process 2 of 4, pid=54729)\r\nUPCR: UPC thread 3 of 4 on f7d7a33ec365 (pshm node 0 of 1, process 3 of 4, pid=54730)\r\nUPC Runtime warning: Requested shared memory (256 MB) > available (9 MB) on node 0 (f7d7a33ec365): using 9 MB per thread instead\r\nSUCCESS: serial.out and pgen_0.out are identical\r\n--- deliverables ---\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root    757 Oct 31 22:17 /app/Makefile\r\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root 854192 Oct 31 22:17 /app/pgen\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  11326 Oct 31 22:16 /app/pgen.upc\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  10114 Oct 31 22:17 /app/pgen_0.out\r\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root  71176 Oct 31 22:17 /app/serial\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   7538 Oct 31 22:17 /app/serial.c\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  10114 Oct 31 22:17 /app/serial.out\r\n--- output summary ---\r\n    6 /app/serial.out\r\n    6 /app/pgen_0.out\r\n   12 total\r\n424328f160b84072be749af701766812074a42dc072769f5af3275344a7f3705  /app/serial.out\r\n424328f160b84072be749af701766812074a42dc072769f5af3275344a7f3705  /app/pgen_0.out\r\n--- contig lengths ---\r\n3590\r\n1467\r\n227\r\n3598\r\n846\r\n380\r\n\r\n"]
